  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EFM Sao Tome e Principe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union intends to send an Electoral Follow-up Mission (EFM) to Sao Tome and Principe to assess the progress made in the electoral reform and the status of implementation of EU Election Observation Mission (EOM) recommendations, since the delivery of the Final report of the EU EOM Sao Tome and Principe 2022. IOM will select 2 Experts (1 Legal and 1 Electoral Expert/Team Leader), who will travel to Sao Tome to meet all relevant stakeholders and produce a report. IOM will have no visibility and will not be associated in any way to the work of the experts; we will provide administrative, logistical and security support.</narrative>
  </description>
